Appello.

526
00:42:17,695 --> 00:42:18,696
I already know.

527
00:42:19,113 --> 00:42:21,198
You like me. Say it's me.

528
00:42:21,615 --> 00:42:22,992
Just say it's me.

529
00:42:23,075 --> 00:42:25,703
Say, "Lee Chan."
Say, "Lee Chan is my bias."

530
00:42:25,786 --> 00:42:27,872
- Appello.
- Lee Chan.

531
00:42:28,289 --> 00:42:29,915
- Appello.
- Lee Chan.

532
00:42:29,999 --> 00:42:31,333
- Appello.
- I'll bite you.

533
