I knew it.

534
00:42:55,066 --> 00:42:56,233
What's with her now?

535
00:42:56,317 --> 00:42:57,401
Let her be.

536
00:42:57,485 --> 00:43:00,237
Hey, Namda!
Come and eat some fried chicken!

537
