Guys, how am I going
to face the CEO from now on?

546
00:43:34,522 --> 00:43:36,899
And what about the entire company
thinking I'm a weird woman?

547
00:43:41,320 --> 00:43:42,613
It was only your first day.

548
00:43:42,696 --> 00:43:44,448
If you do your job well

549
00:43:44,532 --> 00:43:45,866
these rumors will die down quickly.

550
00:43:47,993 --> 00:43:49,870
- Do you think so?
- Of course.

551
00:43:50,329 --> 00:43:52,331
And you're just a rookie.

552
00:43:52,414 --> 00:43:53,749
You won't have to meet the CEO often.

553
00:43:54,083 --> 00:43:55,209
Just avoid him.

554
00:43:56,544 --> 00:43:57,586
Right?

555
00:43:59,046 --> 00:44:02,675
I won't have to meet the CEO

556
00:44:03,342 --> 00:44:04,510
at all, right?

557
00:44:05,177 --> 00:44:06,887
- Not at all.
- Not likely.

558
00:44:08,180 --> 00:44:11,433
Right.
Yes, I doubt I'll have to see him.

559
00:44:11,517 --> 00:44:13,102
No, never again.

560
00:44:16,522 --> 00:44:18,691
I'll work hard
and improve my reputation.

561
00:44:19,066 --> 00:44:20,067
As for the CEO...

562
00:44:21,110 --> 00:44:22,278
I'll avoid him.

563
