It's our first pop-up store
since TUNZI's launch

564
00:44:36,000 --> 00:44:37,960
so please pay extra attention.

565
00:44:38,043 --> 00:44:39,044
- Yes.
- Yes, ma'am.

566
00:44:46,802 --> 00:44:50,097
TUNZI IS A SPACE
FOR DESIGNER MIN-JI'S...

567
00:44:59,982 --> 00:45:01,025
I'll do it!

568
00:45:11,577 --> 00:45:12,828
Let me help!

569
00:45:20,085 --> 00:45:21,921
I'll take it!

570
