The doors are closing.

572
00:46:07,883 --> 00:46:09,093
Work hard.

573
00:46:09,176 --> 00:46:11,637
Avoid the CEO.

574
00:46:27,236 --> 00:46:28,404
The doors are closing.

575
00:46:31,824 --> 00:46:35,244
Hello, we're the rookie employees,
Nam Da-reum...

576
00:46:35,327 --> 00:46:37,162
- Park Young-woo...
- And Lee Min-a!

577
00:46:37,246 --> 00:46:38,580
- Nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you.

578
00:46:40,291 --> 00:46:41,333
- Hello.
- How cute.

579
00:46:41,417 --> 00:46:43,252
- I love the energy.
- It's great to meet you.

580
00:46:43,335 --> 00:46:44,753
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

581
00:46:45,671 --> 00:46:47,423
- We'll do our best!
- We'll do our best!

582
00:46:48,424 --> 00:46:50,634
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

583
00:46:50,718 --> 00:46:51,927
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

584
00:46:52,011 --> 00:46:53,345
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

585
00:46:53,429 --> 00:46:56,098
- We'll do our best!
- We'll do our best!

586
00:46:57,641 --> 00:46:58,767
Thank you.

587
00:46:59,601 --> 00:47:01,270
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

588
00:47:25,794 --> 00:47:29,048
Here comes CEO Kang Ha-gi!

589
00:47:36,013 --> 00:47:37,056
Hello, Mr. Kang!

590
00:47:37,264 --> 00:47:39,350
- Hello, Mr. Kang!
- Hello, Mr. Kang!

591
00:47:39,558 --> 00:47:41,935
- Hello.
- Mr. Kang, please sit over here.

592
00:47:42,019 --> 00:47:44,646
Goodness, no. Why this table?

593
00:47:48,359 --> 00:47:49,401
Have a seat.

594
00:47:52,780 --> 00:47:54,448
I thought you'd be too busy to come.

595
00:47:54,531 --> 00:47:55,866
I have to leave soon

596
00:47:55,949 --> 00:47:57,451
for a video meeting
with a foreign VC firm.

597
00:47:57,534 --> 00:47:58,911
Mr. Kang, would you like a drink

598
00:47:58,994 --> 00:48:00,913
- I have a video meeting.
- Yes, right.

599
00:48:00,996 --> 00:48:02,831
- Can you pour me one?
- Have some.

600
00:48:05,042 --> 00:48:06,585
Why did the atmosphere turn gloomy?

601
00:48:06,668 --> 00:48:09,922
Everyone! Drink up. Come on.

602
00:48:10,005 --> 00:48:12,257
CEO Ha-gi is with us now

603
00:48:12,341 --> 00:48:15,177
so let's have a drink happily!
Drink up!

604
00:48:15,260 --> 00:48:16,804
- Drink up!
- Mr. Kang.

605
00:48:17,096 --> 00:48:18,430
Right. You aren't drinking.

606
00:48:18,889 --> 00:48:20,391
Please give us your guidance.

607
00:48:20,474 --> 00:48:22,059
We look forward to learning a lot.

608
00:48:26,438 --> 00:48:27,981
Let's call it a day quickly.

609
