Don't let the rookies get too drunk.

610
00:48:30,234 --> 00:48:31,276
Yes, sir.

611
00:48:34,905 --> 00:48:36,115
Let's keep drinking!

612
00:48:36,532 --> 00:48:38,992
Da-reum is at a company dinner,
and I'm really concerned.

613
00:48:39,785 --> 00:48:41,954
She'll chug every single drink
without turning anything down.

614
00:48:42,037 --> 00:48:43,539
She's a born nerd.

615
00:48:44,206 --> 00:48:45,833
That's the problem with Namda.

616
00:48:46,583 --> 00:48:48,877
She tries too hard.

617
00:49:02,433 --> 00:49:04,017
- Oh, wow.
- Manager, please have one.

618
00:49:04,101 --> 00:49:06,019
What? Me?

619
00:49:07,438 --> 00:49:09,690
Gosh, Da-reum. I didn't know
you were capable of this.

620
00:49:09,773 --> 00:49:11,442
I learned it from my friends.

621
00:49:11,525 --> 00:49:14,236
You have great friends.
Wait a second, sweetie.

622
00:49:15,863 --> 00:49:17,030
You need a drink from me.

623
00:49:17,364 --> 00:49:18,407
Of course.

624
00:49:18,866 --> 00:49:20,742
- All right.
- Ms. Nam Da-reum.

625
