Sorry?

626
00:49:23,203 --> 00:49:24,204
Take a drink from me instead.

627
00:49:25,873 --> 00:49:27,833
Right. Yes!

628
00:49:29,293 --> 00:49:30,627
Yes, right. Yes.

629
